WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.067
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.300
Thank you for watching
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.534
